### Crc32 KAT

#### CRC32 of 123456789 equals 0xCBF43926

- Verify: CRC32 of 123456789 equals 0xCBF43926


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 8 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: CRC32 of 123456789 equals 0xCBF43926")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
val bytes: [u8] = [49u8, 50u8, 51u8, 52u8, 53u8, 54u8, 55u8, 56u8, 57u8]
val sp = ByteSpan.new(bytes)
var crc = Crc32.new()
crc.update(sp)
val got = crc.raw()
assert_equal(got, 0xCBF43926)
```

</details>

