#### overlapping fixed match copies from newly emitted bytes

- Verify: overlapping fixed match copies from newly emitted bytes


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 18 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: overlapping fixed match copies from newly emitted bytes")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
var w = BitWriter.lsb()
w.put_bits(1, 1)
w.put_bits(1, 1)
w.put_bits(0, 1)
val lit_a = deflate_reverse_bits(48 + 65, 8)
w.put_bits(lit_a, 8)
val len3 = deflate_reverse_bits(1, 7)
w.put_bits(len3, 7)
w.put_bits(0, 5)
w.put_bits(0, 7)
w.align()
val out = inflate_fixed(w.finish().freeze())
val out_sp = out.freeze()
assert_equal(out_sp.len(), 4)
assert_equal(byte_sum(out_sp), 260)
assert_equal(all_bytes_equal(out_sp, 65), 1)
```

</details>

